n1": "Matured RBC", "option2": "Erythrocyte", "option3": "Reticulocyte", "option4": "Late normoblast", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/32_TyhPtXH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"485\" />"}, {"id": "33", "question": "৩৩) Synthesis of plasma protein from liver except:", "option1": "Albumin", "option2": "ᵧ globulin", "option3": "Fibrinogen", "option4": "Prothrombin", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/33_p6RTzDe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"605\" height=\"184\" />"}, {"id": "34", "question": "৩৪) Which is essential for blood coagulation:", "option1": "Albumin", "option2": "ᵧ globulin", "option3": "Factor VII", "option4": "Prothrombin", "answer": "4", "exp": "1<sup>st</sup> four clotting factor are essential"}, {"id": "35", "question": "৩৫) Maturation of the erythroblast involves except:", "option1": "A decrease in cell size", "option2": "Decreased condensation and finally pyknosis of the nucleus ", "option3": "Accumulation of Hb", "option4": "A change in staining reaction of the cytoplasm from basophil to eosinophil.   ", "answer": "2", "exp": "Increased condensation and finally pyknosis of the nucleus"}, {"id": "36", "question": "৩৬) Graveyard of RBCs’: ", "option1": "Liver ", "option2": "Spleen", "option3": "Bone marrow", "option4": "Thymus ", "answer": "2", "exp": "When red cells become older(120days) and fragile, they are destroyed in reticulo-endothelial system. The main destruction occurs in the capillaries of red pulp of spleen because the splenic capillaries diameter is very small. So, spleen is called &lsquo;graveyard of RBCs&rsquo;. &nbsp; &nbsp;"}, {"id": "37", "question": "৩৭) Macrocytic anemia found in-", "option1": "Iron deficiency", "option2": "Folate deficiency", "option3": "haemorrhagic anemia", "option4": "zinc deficiency", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/37.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"767\" height=\"350\" />"}, {"id": "38", "question": "৩৮) Normal RBCs exclude:", "option1": "Circular", "option2": "Bi-concave", "option3": "Nucleated ", "option4": "Each RBC contains 29 pg of Hb", "answer": "3", "exp": "Morphology of RBC<br />Circular, non- nucleated, biconcave disc<br />● Diameter &nbsp;7.8 micrometer<br />● Thickness &nbsp; 2.5 micrometer at thickest point and 1 micrometer or less in the center<br />● Surface area 140micrometer2<br />● Volume&nbsp; &nbsp; 90-95 micrometer3&nbsp;<br />● Each RBC contains 29 pg of Hb"}, {"id": "39", "question": "৩৯) Vasoconstrictor agent:", "option1": "Serotonin", "option2": "Epinephrine in liver", "option3": "Prostaglandin", "option4": "NO", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/39.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"914\" height=\"702\" />"}, {"id": "40", "question": "৪০) Steps of blood coagulation excludes;", "option1": "Prothrombin activation", "option2": "Conversion of prothrombin to thrombin", "option3": "Activation of fibrin stabilizing factor", "option4": "Conversion of fibrinogen into fibrin", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/40.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"452\" />"}, {"id": "41", "question": "৪১) Extrinsic pathway started by :", "option1": "Factor X", "option2": "Factor XII", "option3": "Factor VII", "option4": "Factor VIII", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/41_yi9Gevs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"688\" />"}, {"id": "42", "question": "৪২) Intrinsic pathway take place when injury to-", "option1": "Tissue", "option2": "Blood", "option3": "Factor X", "option4": "Fibrinogen", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/42_h8vG5Xr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"863\" height=\"672\" />"}, {"id": "43", "question": "৪৩) Lysis of blood clots by;", "option1": "Fibrin", "option2": "Thrombin", "option3": "Fibrinogen", "option4": "Plasmin", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/43_jOehuTp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"788\" height=\"589\" />"}, {"id": "44", "question": "৪৪) Granulocytes except:", "option1": "Neutrophil", "option2": "eosinophil", "option3": "Monocyte", "option4": "Basophil", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/44_Ur34AnY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"833\" height=\"657\" />"}, {"id": "45", "question": "৪৫) Component absent in serum:", "option1": "Fibrinogen", "option2": "Thrombin", "option3": "Plasmin", "option4": "Neutrophil", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/45_HvYm55Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"789\" height=\"634\" />"}, {"id": "46", "question": "৪৬) Raw materials for Hb synthesis excludes:", "option1": "Succinyl coA", "option2": "Glycine", "option3": "Fe+++", "option4": "Polypeptide", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/46.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"784\" height=\"562\" />"}, {"id": "47", "question": "৪৭) Conditions with raised ESR:", "option1": "Polycythemia", "option2": "CCF", "option3": "Severe anemia", "option4": "Dehydration", "answer": "3", "exp": "Conditions with increased ESR<br /><br /><strong>Physiological &nbsp;</strong><br />1.Menstruation&nbsp;<br />2. Pregnancy&nbsp;<br />3. High atmospheric pressure<br /><br /><strong>B. Pathological&nbsp;</strong><br />1.Multiple myeloma<br />2. Malignancy&nbsp;<br />3. MI<br />4. Acute rheumatic fever<br />5. Rheumatoid arthritis<br />6. SLE<br />7. Tuberculosis<br />8. Severe anemia<br />9. Hemorrhage"}, {"id": "48", "question": "৪৮) Antigen in RBC for O blood group:", "option1": "A", "option2": "B", "option3": "O", "option4": "No antigen", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/48_F5scfrS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"689\" height=\"283\" />"}, {"id": "49", "question": "৪৯) Prevalence for A blood group:", "option1": "47%", "option2": "41%", "option3": "9%", "option4": "3%", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/49.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"714\" height=\"413\" />"}, {"id": "50", "question": "৫০) Essential blood clotting factor excludes:", "option1": "Fibrinogen", "option2": "prothrombin", "option3": "Stuart power", "option4": "Calcium", "answer": "3", "exp": "1<sup>st</sup> four are essential<br /><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/50_ChzcsGD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"998\" height=\"1067\" />"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 6069, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "2280000", "is_omr": false, "omr_time": "7200000", "examname": "Dec 03, 2023", "type": "BCS-Health-Long", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}